{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07370","headline":"送裴四判官赴河西军试 · 刘长卿","name":"送裴四判官赴河西军试","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吏道岂易惬，如君谁与俦。\n逢时将骋骥，临事无全牛。\n鲍叔幸相知，田苏颇同游。\n英资挺孤秀，清论含古流。\n出塞佐持简，辞家拥鸣驺。\n宪台贵公举，幕府资良筹。\n武士伫明试，皇华难久留。\n阳关望天尽，洮水令人愁。\n万里看一鸟，旷然烟霞收。\n晚花对古戍，春雪含边州。\n道路难暂隔，音尘那可求。\n他时相望处，明月西南楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07370.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07370","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}